        <mxCell id="note1" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Week 8 changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Client stores its accounts in a dict {account_number: Account}; Client 1 — 0..* Account.&lt;br&gt;• add_account / get_account / remove_account work by account number; get_accounts() returns a read-only view.&lt;br&gt;• Account stores transactions in a list, oldest first, exposed only as a copy of the list.&lt;br&gt;• History operations: get_transaction_count(), get_transactions_by_type(), get_transactions_above().&lt;br&gt;• Kept from Week 7: Account is abstract; Savings / Everyday keep their own withdrawal rules." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;strokeColor=#888888;dashed=1;fillColor=none;rounded=0;">
